# A long conversation opens at its latest turns with its model, scrolls, loads
# earlier turns on request, and sends while the reader is there.
# Elements stay in the accessibility tree while scrolled out of view, so the
# screenshots are the evidence of where the reader is.
# iOS: testSimulatorOpensLongInterruptedHistoryAtLatestMessage, testSimulatorLoadsEarlierHistoryOnTapAtTheReadingPosition,
# testSimulatorSendsWithOneTapWhileReadingHistory, testSimulatorAutomaticallyShowsModelControlsInExistingAndRunningConversations
fixture /long-conversation/long-history
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Long conversation" 20000
expect "Review section 14, input 0." 20000
expect "Fixture Model"
expect_absent "Review section 2, input 0."
screenshot latest
scroll "Review section 14, input 0." -20
screenshot scrolled
press 以前のターンを読み込む
expect "Review section 2, input 0." 20000
screenshot earlier
# Sending while reading earlier turns takes one press.
type "AI に依頼する" "[immediate] 履歴を読みながら送ります"
press 送信
expect "シミュレータで完了しました。" 30000
